<title>GREECE: MACEDONIA-THRACE BANK ADDS TWO NEW BRANCHES.</title>
<headline>MACEDONIA-THRACE BANK ADDS TWO NEW BRANCHES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Macedonia-Thrace added two new branches to its network bringing the total to 73, it said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new branches in Sparta at K. Paleologou 55-57 and Agia Paraskevi in Athens at Agiou Ioannou 40 feature the bank's new look. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
